			<string>Sirius</string>
			<string>XM</string>
			<string>SiriusXM</string>
			<string>official-affiliation wording</string>
			<string>provider logos or dog imagery</string>
			<string>channel artwork</string>
			<string>Apple hardware</string>
			<string>standard-control facsimiles</string>
			<string>other players' trade dress</string>
		</array>
		<key>goods</key>
		<string>Native macOS music and radio player for subscribers</string>
		<key>style</key>
		<string>Late-1990s/early-2000s desktop music-player culture: burned CDs, MP3 bitrates, bitmap skins, spectrum scopes, equalizers, and chunky desktop hardware. Prefer one or two easy syllables and avoid forced portmanteaux.</string>
	</dict>
